<section class="section on-cream" id="faq">
  <div class="container faq-wrap">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">FAQ</p>
      <h2>Questions, answered</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq" id="faqList">
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>What is Velacore Health?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Velacore Health is a telehealth platform. We coordinate access to independent, licensed physicians and 503A compounding pharmacies. We do not provide, guarantee, or facilitate any medical services, prescriptions, or treatments — all prescribing decisions are made solely by the independent physician.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do I need a prescription?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Yes. Every treatment is prescription only. You complete an online visit, and an independent, licensed physician decides whether to prescribe based solely on clinical judgment. Prescriptions are issued only when clinically appropriate.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Does Velacore prescribe or provide medical care?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>No. Velacore coordinates access and logistics. Independent, licensed physicians make all clinical decisions, and licensed 503A pharmacies handle fulfillment.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>What happens after I check out?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Your payment starts your physician review — a medical consultation is included. Right after checkout, we send you a secure, HIPAA-compliant medical intake to complete. An independent physician reviews it and decides whether to prescribe. If approved, a licensed 503A pharmacy fills and ships your treatment.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>What is your refund policy?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Our promise is tied to the physician approval process. If the independent reviewing physician does not approve your program — in full or in part — your program payment is refunded in full within 15 days. The one-time $20 physician fee is non-refundable. Medications are non-returnable and non-refundable once dispensed by the pharmacy, as required by federal and state pharmacy law.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Are there any fees besides the medication?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Yes — a one-time <strong>$20 physician fee</strong>, collected on behalf of the independent medical group (not Velacore Health) for the physician's clinical review, and is non-refundable. <strong>Shipping is included</strong> at no additional charge. This fee is separate from the cost of any medication or program.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Will I talk to a real, licensed doctor?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Yes. An independent, licensed physician reviews your intake and makes every prescribing decision. Your day-to-day questions are handled by the Velacore care team, who escalate clinically significant concerns to the prescribing provider.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>How long until my order arrives?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Once the physician approves your treatment, it's compounded by the pharmacy and shipped to you — typically arriving within a few business days. Timing can vary by pharmacy and your location.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Can I cancel or pause anytime?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Yes — there's no long-term contract. You can cancel or pause before your next fulfillment date by contacting the care team. Cancellation stops future charges; it doesn't refund a fulfillment that has already been dispensed.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you take insurance?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Programs are paid out of pocket and are not billed to insurance. Pricing is shown up front, with no surprise fees.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is my personal information private?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Your medical intake is handled on a secure, HIPAA-compliant platform, and vendors that handle your health data operate under appropriate agreements. See our <a href="{{ pages.privacy-policy.url | default: '/policies/privacy-policy' }}">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>What if I have side effects or questions during treatment?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Message the Velacore care team anytime — clinically significant concerns are escalated to the prescribing physician for review. If you're experiencing a medical emergency, call 911 or go to the nearest emergency room.</p></div></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Which states do you serve?</summary><div class="faq-body"><p>Velacore Health telehealth services are available in all 50 US states. Every prescription still requires review by an independent physician licensed for your state, and your prescribing provider may vary based on state availability.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

